# Namespaces

Public namespaces in this repo are the Chromium ones already in the tree: `views`, `aura`, `ui`, `gfx`, `base`, and their existing nested names (`views::internal` where siblings use it).

## Do

- Put new widgets next to peers in the same namespace as the directory (`views` under `ui/views`).
- Put file-local helpers in an anonymous namespace in the `.cc`.

## Don’t

- Don’t collapse `views` into a two-level `ui::views::detail` scheme from smartgis.
- Don’t invent a third product namespace (`mview::shell::…`) for code that belongs in `views` or `aura`.
